<h1>Someone tried to register with your email</h1>

<p>
    An attempt was made to create a new PaySubscriptions account with your email
    address. Because this address is already registered, no new account was
    created and your data is unchanged.
</p>

<p>
    If this was you and you cannot sign in, you can
    <a href="{{ resetUrl }}">reset your password</a>
    or <a href="{{ loginUrl }}">sign in</a>.
    If it was not you, you can safely ignore this email.
</p>

<p>
    Cheers!
</p>
